{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月13日 18:13 星期五</p>\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"dateModified\">最後更新   2026年11月13日 18:20 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>下午時段三時許，鄰近皇崗口岸的落馬洲、新田交匯處車站旁的青山公路疑因地下喉管水掣損壞，食水由水掣噴出，水柱一度高達6至8米。水務署工程人員其後到場處理。附近一帶停水。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>有水務署工程人員在黃昏時間通知附近食店及商戶停水安排，指由新田郵政局到洲頭，以至河套區也停水。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕水務署 停水 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:00:11.744957+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:13:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T12:14:47.009584+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:53:35.402205+00:00","content_hash":"19d900642ef2b09028c757d478243dd1e4233e9761062ce50776cba04122b285","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}